WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/ClimateSection.tsx — a leaf that takes
  a `ClimateSnapshot | null | undefined` prop and renders:
    GlassPanel(p-6) → header[ Wind icon (neon-cyan) + "Climate" title ]
                    → climateData
                        ? grid(2/3/4 cols) of EIGHT MetricCards:
                            Inside Temp   formatTemperature(inside)   Thermometer green
                            Outside Temp  formatTemperature(outside)  Thermometer cyan
                            Driver Setpt  formatTemperature(driver)   Thermometer purple
                            Fan Speed     String(fan) | '—'           Wind        cyan
                            Seat Heater L 'Level n' | '—'             CircleDot   green
                            Seat Heater R 'Level n' | '—'             CircleDot   green
                            Defrost       mode!=='Off'?mode:Off       Snowflake   green/cyan
                            Climate On    on?On:Off                   Flame       green/cyan
                        : EmptyState("No climate data available")
  formatTemperature (lib/unitConversion.ts): null/NaN → '—'; precision 1; °C identity /
  °F = c*9/5+32; "${n}${°U}" with NO separating space. The parent vehicle-detail page owns
  isLoading / error / freshness; reproduced here as the loading/error/stale/offline envelope.

